OL,3,GNEWSACall for lottery gambling controls
OL,4,Aafter dad's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has called for the National
OL,7,FLottery to be included in a
OL,8,Fself-exclusion gambling scheme after a
OL,9,Fman with a gambling addiction took his
OL,10,Fown life.
OL,12,FStephen Goff, 54, died from
OL,13,Fasphyxiation at his flat in Leighton
OL,14,FBuzzard, Bedfordshire, on 18 August
OL,15,F2025, an inquest heard.
OL,17,FEmma Whitting, senior coroner for
OL,18,FBedfordshire and Luton, said there was
OL,19,Fa risk of further deaths unless the
OL,20,FNational Lottery draw was covered by
OL,21,FGAMSTOP.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
